      "body": "基于AI全新打造的一款开源企业级多租户团队协作工具，集成多种功能于一体：[企业即时通讯IM](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/team/readme.zh.md)、[在线客服](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/service/readme.zh.md)、[知识库](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/kbase/readme.zh.md)、[客户之声](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/voc/readme.zh.md)、[工单系统](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/ticket/readme.zh.md)、[AI对话](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/ai/readme.zh.md)、[工作流](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/core/readme.workflow.md)、[呼叫中心](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/plugins/freeswitch/readme.zh.md)、[视频客服](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/plugins/webrtc/readme.zh.md)、[开放平台](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/plugins/readme.md)。提供智能文字客服（在线客服）、智能语音客服（热线客服）、智能外呼、智能营销、智能质检等完整解决方案。\n\n语言 / Language: [中文](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/README.zh.md) | [English](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/README.md)\n\nweiyu\n\n管理后台\nchat\n\n多渠道\nchannel\n\n大模型+智能体\nllm_agent\n\n客服工作台\nagent\n\n介绍\n[企业IM](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/team/readme.zh.md)\n局域网即时通讯\n企业成员管理\n聊天记录监控\n...\n[全渠道客服](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/service/readme.zh.md)\n多渠道接入\n人工客服\n客服Agent智能体，对接自有数据，自动执行操作\n...\n[知识库](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/kbase/readme.zh.md)\n对接大模型\n自定义知识库\nFunction Calling\nMcp\n...\n[工单系统](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/ticket/readme.zh.md)\n工单管理\n工单SLA管理\n工单统计和报表\n...\n[AI Agent](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/ai/readme.zh.md)\nOllama/DeepSeek/ZhipuAI/...\n智能体\n工作流\n...\n[工作流](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/core/readme.workflow.md)\n自定义表单\n自定义流程\n工单流程可视化\n...\n[客户之声](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/modules/voc/readme.zh.md)\n意见反馈\n服务投诉\n问卷调查\n...\n[呼叫中心](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/plugins/freeswitch/readme.zh.md)\n基于FreeSwitch的专业呼叫平台\n支持来电弹屏、自动分配、通话录音\n数据统计，语音与文字服务无缝集成\n[视频客服](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/plugins/webrtc/readme.zh.md)\n基于WebRTC技术的高清视频通话\n支持一键视频对话与屏幕共享\n适用于需要直观展示的服务场景\n[开放平台](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/plugins/readme.md)\n提供完整的RESTful API接口和SDK工具包\n支持与第三方系统无缝集成，实现数据互通\n多语言SDK支持，简化开发集成流程\n快速开始\ngit clone https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk.git\ncd bytedesk/deploy/docker\n# 默认启动（MySQL + Artemis + standard，仅中间件）\n./start.sh mysql artemis standard middleware\n更多启动/停止组合（PostgreSQL、Oracle、RabbitMQ、noai、call、全量启动）请参考 [docker readme](https://github.com/Bytedesk/bytedesk/blob/bytedesk-1.x/deploy/docker/readme.zh.md)。\n\n[Docker部署](https://www.weiyuai.cn/docs/zh-CN/docs/deploy/docker)\n[宝塔面板部署](https://www.weiyuai.cn/docs/zh-CN/docs/deploy/baota)\n[源码启动](https://www.weiyuai.cn/docs/zh-CN/docs/deploy/source)\n演示\n本地预览\n\n# 请将127.0.0.1替换为你的服务器ip\nhttp://127.0.0.1:9003/\n# 开放端口：9003, 9885\n默认用户名: admin@email.com\n默认密码: admin\n项目目录结构\n该仓库为基于 Maven 的多模块单体仓库（根目录 pom.xml）。以下为主要目录与用途说明：\n\nbytedesk/\n├─ channels/           # 渠道接入（抖音/店铺/社交/微信 等）\n├─ demos/              # 示例工程与演示代码\n├─ deploy/             # 部署相关（docker、k8s、server 配置）\n├─ enterprise/         # 企业版能力（ai、call、core、kbase、service、ticket）\n├─ images/             # 文档与界面预览图片\n├─ jmeter/             # 性能测试脚本与说明\n├─ logs/               # 运行日志（本地/开发环境）\n├─ modules/            # 核心业务模块（IM、客服、知识库、工单、AI 等）\n├─ plugins/            # 可选插件（freeswitch、webrtc、开放平台等）\n├─ projects/           # 自定义项目或扩展\n├─ starter/            # 启动器/项目入口",
